{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celtique (Celestial Boutique)</strong> is a high-speed rhythm driving game set on a hostile alien world where music is your only navigation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across vast extraterrestrial landscapes as every turn, boost, and drift is synchronized to the beat. The track <i>is</i> the song - master momentum, timing, and flow as you push your vehicle through  biomechanical highways that react dynamically to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a traditional racing game. Speed alone is not enough. Precision, musical awareness, and instinct define survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Driven Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Steering, acceleration, boosts, and hazards are fully synchronized to the soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Visuals</strong> \u2013 The world pulses, shifts, and evolves with the music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celtique is about entering a trance\u2014where engine noise fades, rhythm takes control, and the road becomes music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the beat.<br>Become the rhythm.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2150900?t=1768309177","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2150900?t=1768309177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150900/d35b012cec3f42c655fc8bd8800c315d995d6923/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768309177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150900/d35b012cec3f42c655fc8bd8800c315d995d6923/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768309177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celtique (Celestial Boutique)</strong> is a high-speed rhythm driving game set on a hostile alien world where music is your only navigation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across vast extraterrestrial landscapes as every turn, boost, and drift is synchronized to the beat. The track <i>is</i> the song - master momentum, timing, and flow as you push your vehicle through  biomechanical highways that react dynamically to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a traditional racing game. Speed alone is not enough. Precision, musical awareness, and instinct define survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Driven Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Steering, acceleration, boosts, and hazards are fully synchronized to the soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Visuals</strong> \u2013 The world pulses, shifts, and evolves with the music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celtique is about entering a trance\u2014where engine noise fades, rhythm takes control, and the road becomes music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the beat.<br>Become the rhythm.</p>","developers":["James McGowan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150900/c63c8bad00a57be3c384b98b0449118c9c8fe202/header.jpg?t=1768309177","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2150900/833476394/7263c3b4a77c7c6693a5bb75dc9b28ec69acca73/1768284608/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768285278","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s